"1"
"Etheros is no more."
"The sickly shadow that choked"
"Araxia thins, and warm light"
"pours across the land once more."
" "
" ",2
"",0
"",0
"2"
"Rivers run clear once again."
"Blighted fields turn green, and"
"the walking dead of his making"
"crumble quietly into dust."
" "
" ",3
"",0
"",0
"3"
"You return to Thunder Bay to"
"cheering crowds. Bells ring out"
"from every tower, and strangers"
"weep and clasp your hands."
" "
" ",4
"",0
"",0
"4"
"The five Holy Relics are laid"
"to rest in a hall of light,"
"and your name is spoken beside"
"the old heroes of legend."
" "
" ",5
"",0
"",0
"5"
"Long after, parents tell the"
"tale to wide-eyed children:"
"how one soul walked into the"
"dark, and carried back the dawn."
